// S-709: the `use` of the item of a flow that does not have it (`one`) first, then the one of a flow that has
// it (`gain`). The first is E0302 of the types stage; the second is E0304 of the names stage (the first was a
// resolved binding when the names were collected).
use dsp.synth.one.{process_inplace}                 //~ E0302
use dsp.synth.gain.{process_inplace}                //~ E0304
